// The return and warranty policy of Calloway Cycles (policy.md).
Document "policy.md".

Role shop Is Calloway
Fact customer
Fact item
Fact proof Identified by Receipt, NoReceipt
Param return-window : Duration = 30
Param warranty : Duration = 365

// The sale: who bought what, for how much, and whether as final sale
Fact bought Identified by customer * item
Function price Identified by item * amount : USD
Input Fact final-sale Identified by item
Act sell Actor shop Recipient customer Related to item, amount : USD
  Holds when True
  Creates bought(customer, item), price(item, amount)

// 1. Returns: thirty days; a refund with the receipt, store credit without; not final sale
Fact returnable Identified by customer * item
  Default bought-within-thirty-days Holds when bought(customer, item) && !Held(bought(customer, item)) For return-window
  Exception sold-as-final-sale Overrides bought-within-thirty-days Rejects when final-sale(item)
Fact store-credit Identified by customer * item
Act return Actor customer Related to item, proof
  Holds when True
  Valid when returnable(customer, item)
  Creates refund-due(shop, customer, item) When proof == Receipt
        , store-credit(customer, item) When proof == NoReceipt
  Terminates bought(customer, item)

// 2. Warranty: a defect within the year is repaired or replaced within thirty days
Fact defective Identified by item
Fact covered Identified by item
Event defect-found Related to item
  Creates defective(item)
        , covered(item) When (Exists customer: bought(customer, item) && !Held(bought(customer, item)) For warranty)
Act bring-in Actor customer Related to item
  Holds when True
  Valid when bought(customer, item) && covered(item)
  Creates repair-due(shop, customer, item)
Duty repair-due Holder shop Claimant customer Related to item
  Due within 30 days
  Terminated by repair, replace
Act repair Actor shop Recipient customer Related to item
  Valid when !Violated(repair-due(shop, customer, item))
  Terminates defective(item)
Act replace Actor shop Recipient customer Related to item
  Valid when !Violated(repair-due(shop, customer, item))
  Terminates defective(item)

// 3. Refunds: due on a return with the receipt, or when the repair is overdue; paid in ten days
Duty refund-due Holder shop Claimant customer Related to item
  Holds when Violated(repair-due(shop, customer, item))
  Due within 10 days
  Terminated by refund
Act refund Actor shop Recipient customer Related to item, amount : USD
  Valid when price(item) == amount
  Terminates repair-due(shop, customer, item)

Clause 1.1 => shop, return-window, bought-within-thirty-days, sell, return
Clause 1.2 => return, refund-due, refund, store-credit
Clause 1.3 => final-sale, sold-as-final-sale
Clause 2.1 => warranty, defect-found, bring-in, repair-due, repair, replace
Clause 2.2 => repair, replace, refund-due, refund
Clause 3.1 => refund-due, refund.
